            "type": "text",
            "text": "My day starts at 7:00 AM. I eat a healthy breakfast and take the bus to work. At work, I listen to music, read emails, and write reports. I have lunch at a local café with colleagues. After work, I meet friends at the park, then go home to study English and watch TV. In the evening, I enjoy reading books before going to bed."
